{"title":"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(FASTER!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (FASTER!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The product of the two <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />-digit numbers\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/f/bcfa983bfbf490e0320c80b07a9d1f835efa8093.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$303,030,303,...,030,303$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"191\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/e/1ee2cf7a6b3a3ec3d6612843cd5c46dd838b5ef8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$505,050,505,...,050,505$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"191\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>has thousands digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and units digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. What is the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/4/4445098e29af05e56ad524a7f22610797f8fe7bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 8 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can first make a small example to find out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. So, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/8/03890a0097c404e405a2adadeec07d81186f7b46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$303\\times505=153015$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"154\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>The ones digit plus thousands digit is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/3/ca37de60578e17f891939b7176e68bd4dc74e0e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5+3=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Note that the ones and thousands digits are, added together, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. (and so on...) So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/4/114228a01e21efe5394aa489ccef5bb000ccd93d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />\nThis is a direct multiplication way.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28FASTER.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(FASTER!)\">Solution 2 (FASTER!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (FASTER!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Just solve it by hand to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/0/80039f0688239989d6e3f77d6be9f2611dc6017e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$153321489657825994162330498666835003171339507675844012180348516684853021189357525693862030198366534396228059891723555387219050882714546378210041873705537369201032864696528360192023855687519351183015$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1802\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Then, the ones digit plus thousands digit is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/3/ca37de60578e17f891939b7176e68bd4dc74e0e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5+3=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />. So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/4/114228a01e21efe5394aa489ccef5bb000ccd93d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p><br />\nfrfr best way this is what i did during the amc 8\nim that old call me unccccc\n67\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/7an5wU9Q5hk?t=2085\">https://youtu.be/7an5wU9Q5hk?t=2085</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/_goaFuScO6M\">https://youtu.be/_goaFuScO6M</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8\" title=\"2007 AMC 8\">2007 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2007\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php